  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "IF IT AIN'T THE GOLDEN CHILD."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "never seen YCV in the sunshine before."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Got to catch him in the daylight."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "old farts in the rest home turn in early."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "MEX! how many times have i told you to show some RESPECT!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "You call him \"mister,\" you call him \"PAFA Dino\"..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "You don't get out of my way. Marvin..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...and I'm not gonna call him at all."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "WHH--"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...Hey."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Hey, Ash."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Y'know, I used to be a big fan of yours."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Hey, you ever gonna make any more movies? I think you're still young enough."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "DIRTBAG."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Wm- what was that?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "i SAID that you were a DIR7BAG, marvin."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "but i was 7MMKING that you were also a FAT PIG."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I'll KWE you, you little--"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "EASY, MARVIN, EASY!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Slam"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "PUNK..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Just a punk..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "FUCKW'... if he wasn't papa's pet, I'd...I'd F- Fuckin'..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Jesus C#R/S7, marry, full yourself together! He's just a goddamn kid!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "\"Kid\"? Oh, yeah... that's always been his act. Just a kid, right."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Lemme tell you, though... one fine day, I swear I'm gonna snap that worthless little queer's neck."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "!!!!!"
    }
  ],
